e</span></p><p begin="00:04.545" end="00:08.356" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:04.545" end="00:04.893">続</span><span begin="00:04.893" end="00:05.097">け</span> <span begin="00:05.218" end="00:05.569">繋</span><span begin="00:05.569" end="00:05.734">げ</span> <span begin="00:05.908" end="00:06.227">君</span><span begin="00:06.227" end="00:06.407">だ</span><span begin="00:06.407" end="00:06.554">け</span><span begin="00:06.554" end="00:06.678">の</span><span begin="00:06.678" end="00:06.749">ス</span><span begin="00:06.749" end="00:07.076">トー</span><span begin="00:07.076" end="00:08.356">リー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">串联 续写 只属于你的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsuzuke tsunage kimi dake no sutoorii</span></p><p begin="00:18.704" end="00:23.882" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:18.704" end="00:18.885">め</span><span begin="00:18.885" end="00:19.076">く</span><span begin="00:19.076" end="00:19.456">る</span><span begin="00:20.052" end="00:20.216">ペ</span><span begin="00:20.216" end="00:20.382">ー</span><span begin="00:20.382" end="00:20.774">ジ</span> <span begin="00:21.393" end="00:21.512">う</span><span begin="00:21.512" end="00:21.744">さ</span><span begin="00:21.744" end="00:22.079">ぎ</span><span begin="00:22.079" end="00:22.223">の</span><span begin="00:22.223" end="00:22.411">し</span><span begin="00:22.411" end="00:22.589">お</span><span begin="00:22.589" end="00:22.747">り</span><span begin="00:22.747" end="00:22.910">も</span><span begin="00:22.910" end="00:23.101">跳</span><span begin="00:23.101" end="00:23.320">ね</span><span begin="00:23.440" end="00:23.882">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">翻动的书页里 兔子书签蹦跳起舞</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mekuru peeji usagi no shiori mo hanete</span></p><p begin="00:24.113" end="00:29.313" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:24.113" end="00:24.275">め</span><span begin="00:24.275" end="00:24.435">ぐ</span><span begin="00:24.435" end="00:24.819">る</span><span begin="00:25.437" end="00:25.771">旅</span><span begin="00:25.771" end="00:26.115">路</span> <span begin="00:26.783" end="00:26.951">あ</span><span begin="00:26.951" end="00:27.101">た</span><span begin="00:27.101" end="00:27.464">し</span><span begin="00:27.464" end="00:27.620">た</span><span begin="00:27.620" end="00:27.802">ち</span><span begin="00:27.802" end="00:27.974">は</span><span begin="00:27.974" end="00:28.149">ア</span><span begin="00:28.149" end="00:28.279">リ</span><span begin="00:28.279" end="00:28.473">ス</span><span begin="00:28.473" end="00:28.688">な</span><span begin="00:28.688" end="00:28.826">ん</span><span begin="00:28.826" end="00:29.313">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">辗转的旅途中 我们便是那爱丽丝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Meguru tabiji atashitachi wa Arisu nanda</span></p><p begin="00:29.496" end="00:34.627" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:29.496" end="00:29.661">午</span><span begin="00:29.661" end="00:30.216">前</span><span begin="00:30.836" end="00:31.168">0</span><span begin="00:31.168" end="00:31.665">時</span> <span begin="00:32.199" end="00:32.368">夜</span><span begin="00:32.368" end="00:32.519">更</span><span begin="00:32.519" end="00:32.842">か</span><span begin="00:32.842" end="00:33.007">し</span><span begin="00:33.007" end="00:33.210">し</span><span begin="00:33.210" end="00:33.371">ちゃ</span><span begin="00:33.371" end="00:33.525">う</span><span begin="00:33.525" end="00:33.720">よ</span><span begin="00:33.720" end="00:33.880">ね</span><span begin="00:33.880" end="00:34.086">み</span><span begin="00:34.086" end="00:34.233">ん</span><span begin="00:34.233" end="00:34.627">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">午夜0点时 大家都还舍不得入眠吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Gozen reiji yofukashi shichau yo ne minna</span></p><p begin="00:34.895" end="00:40.382" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:34.895" end="00:35.059">は</span><span begin="00:35.059" end="00:35.229">や</span><span begin="00:35.229" end="00:35.665">る</span><span begin="00:36.221" end="00:36.399">気</span><span begin="00:36.399" end="00:36.573">持</span><span begin="00:36.573" end="00:36.970">ち</span> <span begin="00:37.575" end="00:37.911">好</span><span begin="00:37.911" end="00:38.234">奇</span><span begin="00:38.234" end="00:38.599">心</span><span begin="00:38.599" end="00:38.755">と</span><span begin="00:38.755" end="00:38.932">よ</span><span begin="00:38.932" end="00:39.095">ー</span><span begin="00:39.095" end="00:39.271">い</span><span begin="00:39.271" end="00:39.454">と</span><span begin="00:39.454" end="00:39.619">ん</span><span begin="00:39.619" end="00:40.270">だ</span><span begin="00:40.270" end="00:40.382">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">带着雀跃的心情和好奇心 准备——出发！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hayaru kimochi koukishin to yooi donda!</span></p><p begin="00:40.787" end="00:46.053" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:40.787" end="00:41.443">そう</span> <span begin="00:41.642" end="00:41.966">誰</span><span begin="00:41.966" end="00:42.669">も</span><span begin="00:42.996" end="00:43.110">貸</span><span begin="00:43.110" end="00:43.320">し</span><span begin="00:43.320" end="00:43.655">借</span><span begin="00:43.655" end="00:43.826">り</span><span begin="00:43.826" end="00:44.010">の</span><span begin="00:44.010" end="00:44.160">で</span><span begin="00:44.160" end="00:44.314">き</span><span begin="00:44.314" end="00:44.507">な</span><span begin="00:44.507" end="00:44.653">い</span><span begin="00:44.653" end="00:45.190">毎</span><span begin="00:45.300" end="00:46.053">日</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">是啊 每天都是无法转借他人的美好时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Sou dare mo kashikari no dekinai mainichi</span></p><p begin="00:46.312" end="00:50.609" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:46.312" end="00:46.487">未</span><span begin="00:46.487" end="00:46.679">知</span><span begin="00:46.679" end="00:46.933">と</span><span begin="00:47.022" end="00:47.362">道</span><span begin="00:47.362" end="00:47.586">が</span><span begin="00:47.703" end="00:47.970">交</span><span begin="00:47.970" end="00:48.159">差</span><span begin="00:48.159" end="00:48.383">す</span><span begin="00:48.383" end="00:48.600">る</span> <span begin="00:48.883" end="00:49.725">ライ</span><span begin="00:49.725" end="00:49.894">ブ</span><span begin="00:49.894" end="00:50.059">ラ</span><span begin="00:50.059" end="00:50.609">リー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">未知和道路交错的图书馆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Michi to michi ga kousa suru raiburarii</span></p><p begin="00:51.086" end="00:51.751" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:51.086" end="00:51.248">あ</span><span begin="00:51.248" end="00:51.434">る</span><span begin="00:51.434" end="00:51.680">よ</span><span begin="00:51.680" end="00:51.751">！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有的哦！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aru yo!</span></p><p begin="00:51.918" end="00:54.409" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:51.918" end="00:52.584">小説</span><span begin="00:52.584" end="00:52.775">よ</span><span begin="00:52.775" end="00:52.928">り</span><span begin="00:52.928" end="00:53.080">も</span><span begin="00:53.080" end="00:53.236">不</span><span begin="00:53.236" end="00:53.438">思</span><span begin="00:53.438" end="00:53.775">議</span><span begin="00:53.775" end="00:53.931">な</span><span begin="00:53.931" end="00:54.110">こ</span><span begin="00:54.110" end="00:54.409">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">比小说更不可思议</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Fikushon yori mo fushigi na koto</span></p><p begin="00:54.610" end="00:57.070" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:54.610" end="00:54.951">夢</span><span begin="00:54.951" end="00:55.131">の</span><span begin="00:55.131" end="00:55.463">夢</span><span begin="00:55.463" end="00:55.618">が</span><span begin="00:55.618" end="00:55.951">正</span><span begin="00:55.951" end="00:56.462">夢</span><span begin="00:56.462" end="00:56.631">な</span><span begin="00:56.631" end="00:56.812">こ</span><span begin="00:56.812" end="00:57.070">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">梦中之梦竟也成真</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yume no yume ga masayume na koto</span></p><p begin="00:57.305" end="00:59.684" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:57.305" end="00:57.476">つ</span><span begin="00:57.476" end="00:57.638">ま</span><span begin="00:57.638" end="00:57.836">ず</span><span begin="00:57.836" end="00:57.985">い</span><span begin="00:57.985" end="00:58.133">て</span> <span begin="00:58.133" end="00:58.502">転</span><span begin="00:58.502" end="00:58.662">ん</span><span begin="00:58.662" end="00:58.820">で</span> <span begin="00:58.820" end="00:59.000">落</span><span begin="00:59.000" end="00:59.153">っ</span><span begin="00:59.153" end="00:59.326">こ</span><span begin="00:59.326" end="00:59.500">ち</span><span begin="00:59.500" end="00:59.684">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">哪怕会跌跌撞撞陷入迷途</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsumazuite koronde okkochite</span></p><p begin="00:59.830" end="01:02.106" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:59.830" end="00:59.987">予</span><span begin="00:59.987" end="01:00.325">測</span><span begin="01:00.325" end="01:00.496">不</span><span begin="01:00.496" end="01:00.672">可</span><span begin="01:00.672" end="01:00.819">の</span><span begin="01:00.819" end="01:01.169">ワン</span><span begin="01:01.169" end="01:01.315">ダ</span><span begin="01:01.315" end="01:01.576">ー</span><span begin="01:01.683" end="01:02.106">ランド</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这难以预测的梦幻奇境</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yosoku fuka no wandaarando</span></p><p begin="01:02.694" end="01:05.163" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:02.694" end="01:03.045">Tick-</span><span begin="01:03.045" end="01:03.402">Tock</span> <span begin="01:03.542" end="01:03.709">か</span><span begin="01:03.709" end="01:03.878">け</span><span begin="01:03.878" end="01:04.007">が</span><span begin="01:04.007" end="01:04.225">え</span><span begin="01:04.225" end="01:04.380">な</span><span begin="01:04.380" end="01:04.564">い</span><span begin="01:04.564" end="01:04.896">今</span><span begin="01:04.896" end="01:05.163">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Tick-Tock 在无可替代的此刻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tick-Tock kakegaenai ima o</span></p><p begin="01:05.370" end="01:07.790" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:05.370" end="01:05.730">Tick-</span><span begin="01:05.730" end="01:06.066">Tock</span> <span begin="01:06.247" end="01:06.578">限</span><span begin="01:06.578" end="01:06.751">り</span><span begin="01:06.751" end="01:06.918">あ</span><span begin="01:06.918" end="01:07.252">る</span><span begin="01:07.252" end="01:07.587">時間</span><span begin="01:07.587" end="01:07.790">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Tick-Tock 在这有限的时光里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tick-Tock kagiri aru toki o</span></p><p begin="01:08.080" end="01:10.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:08.080" end="01:08.616">喜</span><span begin="01:08.616" end="01:08.779">ん</span><span begin="01:08.779" end="01:08.924">で</span> <span begin="01:08.924" end="01:09.246">怒</span><span begin="01:09.246" end="01:09.444">っ</span><span begin="01:09.444" end="01:09.611">て</span> <span begin="01:09.611" end="01:09.908">愛</span><span begin="01:09.908" end="01:10.105">し</span><span begin="01:10.105" end="01:10.233">ま</span><span begin="01:10.233" end="01:10.463">しょう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管欢笑 尽管生气 尽管去爱吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Yorokonde okotte aishimashou</span></p><p begin="01:10.614" end="01:12.905" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:10.614" end="01:10.929">楽</span><span begin="01:10.929" end="01:11.122">し</span><span begin="01:11.122" end="01:11.302">む</span><span begin="01:11.302" end="01:11.462">の</span><span begin="01:11.462" end="01:11.621">だ</span> <span begin="01:11.62