an begin="01:30.502" end="01:30.858">ん</span><span begin="01:31.516" end="01:31.692">へ</span><span begin="01:31.692" end="01:31.858">ー</span><span begin="01:31.858" end="01:32.208">き</span><span begin="01:32.208" end="01:32.277">”</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“没关系”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">"Tabun heeki"</span></p><p begin="01:32.866" end="01:35.215" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:32.866" end="01:33.535">温</span><span begin="01:33.535" end="01:33.720">か</span><span begin="01:33.720" end="01:33.883">い</span><span begin="01:33.883" end="01:34.201">紅</span><span begin="01:34.201" end="01:34.387">茶</span><span begin="01:34.387" end="01:34.541">の</span><span begin="01:34.541" end="01:34.709">よ</span><span begin="01:34.709" end="01:34.903">う</span><span begin="01:34.903" end="01:35.215">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那温润如红茶般的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Atatakai koucha no youna</span></p><p begin="01:35.215" end="01:37.601" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:35.215" end="01:35.724">言</span><span begin="01:35.724" end="01:35.896">葉</span><span begin="01:35.896" end="01:36.425">も</span><span begin="01:36.917" end="01:37.227">大</span><span begin="01:37.227" end="01:37.601">事</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也很重要</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kotoba mo daiji</span></p><p begin="01:37.925" end="01:40.967" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:37.925" end="01:38.262">あ</span><span begin="01:38.262" end="01:38.438">く</span><span begin="01:38.438" end="01:38.604">び</span><span begin="01:38.604" end="01:38.951">を</span><span begin="01:38.951" end="01:39.112">す</span><span begin="01:39.112" end="01:39.274">る</span><span begin="01:39.274" end="01:39.616">猫</span><span begin="01:39.616" end="01:39.783">も</span><span begin="01:39.783" end="01:40.153">笑</span><span begin="01:40.153" end="01:40.298">っ</span><span begin="01:40.298" end="01:40.967">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">连瞌睡的小猫听到都展露笑意</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Akubi o suru neko mo waratta</span></p><p begin="01:41.448" end="01:46.845" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:41.448" end="01:42.161">ああ</span><span begin="01:42.320" end="01:42.478">未</span><span begin="01:42.478" end="01:43.305">来</span> <span begin="01:43.651" end="01:43.790">ポ</span><span begin="01:43.790" end="01:43.996">ー</span><span begin="01:43.996" end="01:44.324">カー</span><span begin="01:44.324" end="01:44.515">よ</span><span begin="01:44.515" end="01:44.674">り</span><span begin="01:44.674" end="01:44.793">も</span><span begin="01:44.793" end="01:45.154">先</span><span begin="01:45.154" end="01:45.315">が</span><span begin="01:45.315" end="01:45.674">読</span><span begin="01:45.674" end="01:46.007">め</span><span begin="01:46.007" end="01:46.338">な</span><span begin="01:46.338" end="01:46.845">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">未来啊 比牌局更不可预测</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aa mirai pookaa yori mo saki ga yomenai</span></p><p begin="01:47.011" end="01:51.256" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:47.011" end="01:47.356">踊</span><span begin="01:47.356" end="01:47.601">る</span><span begin="01:47.707" end="01:47.842">ハ</span><span begin="01:47.842" end="01:48.030">ー</span><span begin="01:48.030" end="01:48.260">ト</span><span begin="01:48.366" end="01:48.866">現実</span><span begin="01:48.866" end="01:49.014">こ</span><span begin="01:49.014" end="01:49.280">そ</span> <span begin="01:49.538" end="01:50.339">ミ</span><span begin="01:50.339" end="01:50.563">ス</span><span begin="01:50.563" end="01:50.745">テ</span><span begin="01:50.745" end="01:51.256">リー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">心脏跃动不已的现实 才是谜题</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Odoru haato riaru koso misuterii</span></p><p begin="01:51.756" end="01:52.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:51.756" end="01:51.905">い</span><span begin="01:51.905" end="01:52.084">る</span><span begin="01:52.084" end="01:52.380">よ！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有的哦！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Iru yo!</span></p><p begin="01:52.558" end="01:55.011" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:52.558" end="01:52.929">人間</span><span begin="01:52.929" end="01:53.176">と</span><span begin="01:53.176" end="01:53.273">し</span><span begin="01:53.273" end="01:53.450">て</span><span begin="01:53.450" end="01:53.580">生</span><span begin="01:53.580" end="01:53.767">き</span><span begin="01:53.767" end="01:53.939">て</span><span begin="01:53.939" end="01:54.104">く</span><span begin="01:54.104" end="01:54.592">人</span><span begin="01:54.592" end="01:54.785">魚</span><span begin="01:54.785" end="01:55.011">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">变成人类生活的人鱼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hito to shite ikiteku ningyo mo</span></p><p begin="01:55.258" end="01:57.743" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:55.258" end="01:55.463">お</span><span begin="01:55.463" end="01:55.753">月</span><span begin="01:55.753" end="01:56.131">様</span><span begin="01:56.131" end="01:56.294">に</span><span begin="01:56.294" end="01:56.469">な</span><span begin="01:56.469" end="01:56.629">れ</span><span begin="01:56.629" end="01:56.796">た</span><span begin="01:56.796" end="01:57.481">海月</span><span begin="01:57.481" end="01:57.743">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">化作海中之月的水母</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Otsukisama ni nareta kurage mo</span></p><p begin="01:57.973" end="02:00.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:57.973" end="01:58.162">綺</span><span begin="01:58.162" end="01:58.499">麗</span><span begin="01:58.499" end="01:58.662">っ</span><span begin="01:58.662" end="01:58.828">て</span><span begin="01:58.828" end="01:58.993">た</span><span begin="01:58.993" end="01:59.157">め</span><span begin="01:59.157" end="01:59.497">息</span><span begin="01:59.497" end="01:59.711">落</span><span begin="01:59.711" end="01:59.842">っ</span><span begin="01:59.842" end="01:59.986">こ</span><span begin="01:59.986" end="02:00.167">ち</span><span begin="02:00.167" end="02:00.335">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">都美得令人惊叹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kirei tte tameiki okkochite</span></p><p begin="02:00.490" end="02:02.688" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:00.490" end="02:00.679">未</span><span begin="02:00.679" end="02:01.008">体</span><span begin="02:01.008" end="02:01.350">験</span><span begin="02:01.350" end="02:01.515">の</span><span begin="02:01.515" end="02:01.855">ワン</span><span begin="02:01.855" end="02:02.033">ダ</span><span begin="02:02.033" end="02:02.236">ー</span><span begin="02:02.365" end="02:02.688">ランド</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这未曾体验的梦幻奇境</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Mitaiken no wandaarando</span></p><p begin="02:03.364" end="02:05.792" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:03.364" end="02:03.705">Tick-</span><span begin="02:03.705" end="02:04.068">Tock</span> <span begin="02:04.209" end="02:04.369">ト</span><span begin="02:04.369" end="02:04.559">キ</span><span begin="02:04.559" end="02:04.723">メ</span><span begin="02:04.723" end="02:04.891">キ</span><span begin="02:04.891" end="02:05.068">追</span><span begin="02:05.068" end="02:05.222">い</span><span begin="02:05.222" end="02:05.382">か</span><span begin="02:05.382" end="02:05.569">け</span><span begin="02:05.569" end="02:05.792">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Tick-Tock 追逐这份悸动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tick-Tock tokimeki oikakete</span></p><p begin="02:05.883" end="02:09.427" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:05.883" end="02:06.234">続</span><span begin="02:06.234" end="02:06.431">け</span> <span begin="02:06.573" end="02:06.904">繋</span><span begin="02:06.904" end="02:07.114">げ</span> <span begin="02:07.244" end="02:07.591">君</span><span begin="02:07.591" end="02:07.752">だ</span><span begin="02:07.752" end="02:07.939">け</span><span begin="02:07.939" end="02:08.032">の</span><span begin="02:08.032" end="02:08.103">ス</span><span begin="02:08.103" end="02:08.447">トー</span><span begin="02:08.447" end="02:09.427">リー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">串联 续写 只属于你的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsuzuke tsunage kimi dake no sutoorii</span></p><p begin="02:09.271" end="02:13.113" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:09.271" end="02:09.439">会</span><span begin="02:09.439" end="02:09.620">い</span><span begin="02:09.620" end="02:09.966">たい</span><span begin="02:09.966" end="02:10.266">と</span><span begin="02:10.266" end="02:10.605">き</span><span begin="02:10.605" end="02:10.955">は</span><span begin="02:11.123" end="02:11.444">読</span><span begin="02:11.444" end="02:11.627">み</span><span begin="02:11.627" end="02:11.933">返</span><span begin="02:11.933" end="02:12.289">し</span><span begin="02:12.289" end="02:12.644">て</span><span begin="02:12.644" end="02:13.113">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">想见面的时候 就反复翻阅吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Aitai toki wa yomikaeshite yo</span></p><p begin="02:13.317" end="02:15.487" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:13.317" end="02:13.663">君</span><span begin="02:13.663" end="02:14.148">と</span> <span begin="02:14.663" end="02:14.828">あ</span><span begin="02:14.828" end="02:14.971">た</span><span begin="02:14.971" end="02:15.487">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你与我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi to atashi</span></p><p begin="02:13.952" end="02:15.945" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:13.952" end="02:14.315">君</span><span begin="02:14.315" end="02:14.765">と</span> <span begin="02:15.336" end="02:15.507">あ</span><span begin="02:15.507" end="02:15.628">た</span><span begin="02:15.628" end="02:15.945">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你与我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kimi to atashi</span></p><p begin="02:15.989" end="02:20.560" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:15.989" end="02:16.159">お</span><span begin="02:16.159" end="02:16.340">そ</span><span begin="02:16.340" end="02:17.539">ろ</span><span begin="02:17.539" end="02:17.704">い</span><span begin="02:17.704" end="02:18.030">の</span><span begin="02:18.030" end="02:18.383">1</span><span begin="02:18.383" end="02:18.690">ペー</span><span begin="02:18.690" end="02:18.887">ジ</span><span begin="02:18.887" end="02:19.059">目</span><span begin="02:19.059" end="02:20.560">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那相同的第一页</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Osoroi no ichi peeji me o</span></p><p begin="02:29.510" end="02:30.156" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:29.510" end="02:29.698">ほ</span><span begin="02:29.698" end="02:29.858">ら</span><span begin="02:29.858" end="02:30.156">ね！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你看！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Hora ne!</span></p><p begin="02:30.336" end="02:33.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:30.336" end="02:31.005">小説</span><span begin="02:31.005" end="02:31.195">よ</span><span begin="02:31.195" end="02:31.352">り</span><span begin="02:31.352" end="02:31.485">も</span><span begin="02:31.485" end="02:31.680">素</span><span begin="02:31.680" end="02:32.198">敵</span><span begin="02:32.198" end="02:32.377">な</span><span begin="02:32.377" end="02:32.544">こ</span><span begin="02:32.544" end="02:33.440">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">比小说更美好的瞬间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Fikushon yori mo suteki na koto</span></p><p begin="02:33.868" end="02:35.552" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:33.868" end="02:34.212">数</span><span begin="02:34.212" end="02:34.381">え</span><span begin="02:34.381" end="02:34.565">き</span><span begin="02:34.565" end="02:34.920">れ</span><span begin="02:34.920" end="02:35.068">な</span><span begin="02:35.068" end="02:35.229">い</span><span begin="02:35.229" end="02:35.552">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">数都数不清</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Kazoekirenai yo</span></p><p begin="02:35.854" end="02:37.597" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:35.854" end="02:36.064">セ</span><span begin="02:36.064" end="02:36.249">オ</span><span begin="02:36.249" end="02:36.393">リ</span><span begin="02:36.393" end="02:36.582">ー</span><span begin="02:36.582" end="02:36.821">は</span><span begin="02:36.919" end="02:37.083">ど</span><span begin="02:37.083" end="02:37.314">こ</span><span begin="02:37.314" end="02:37.532">へ</span><span begin="02:37.532" end="02:37.597">！？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">常理也早已不知所踪！？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Seorii wa doko e!?</span></p><p begin="02:37.597" end="02:38.279" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:37.597" end="02:37.754">ど</span><span begin="02:37.754" end="02:37.926">こ</span><span begin="02:37.926" end="02:38.220">へ</span><span begin="02:38.220" end="02:38.279">！？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">去了哪里！？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Doko e!?</span></p><p begin="02:38.279" end="02:40.586" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="02:38.279" end="02:38.483">な</span><span begin="02:38.483" end="02:38.609">ん</span><span begin="02:38.609" end="02:38.776">で</span><span begin="02:38.776" end="02:38.958">も</span><span begin="02:38.958" end="02:39.107">あ</span><span begin="02:39.107" end="02:39.244">り</span><span begin="02:39.244" end="02:39.292">！？</span> <span begin="02:39.292" end="02:39.613">ワン</span><span begin="02:39.613" end="02:39.787">ダ</span><span begin="02:39.787" end="02:40.023">ー</span><span begin="02:40.116" end="02:40.586">ランド</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在这座梦幻仙境 一切皆有可能！？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Nandemo ari!? Wandaarando</span></p><p begin="02:41.125" end="02:43.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="02:41.125" end="02:41.458">Tick-</span><span begin="02:41.458" end="02:41.726">Tock</span> <span begin="02:41.959" end="02:42.136">か</span><span begin="02:42.136" end="02:42.312">け</span><span begin="02:42.312" end="02:42.460">が</span><span begin="02:42.460" end="02:42.639">え</span><span begin="02:42.639" end="02:42.816">な</span><span begin="02:42.816" end="02:42.979">い</span><span begin="02:42.979" end="02:43.316">今</span><span begin="02:43.316" end="02:43.609">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Tick-Tock 在无可替代的此刻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tick-Tock kakegaenai ima o</span></p><p begin="02:43.816" end="02:46.256" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="02:43.816" end="02:43.997">目</span><span begin="02:43.997" end="02:44.166">の</span><span begin="02:44.166" end="02:44.495">前</span><span begin="02:44.495" end="02:44.666">の</span><span begin="02:44.666" end="02:45.010">限</span><span begin="02:45.010" end="02:45.165">り</span><span begin="02:45.165" end="02:45.351">あ</span><span begin="02:45.351" end="02:45.668">る</span><span begin="02:45.668" end="02:46.025">時間</span><span begin="02:46.025" end="02:46.256">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在眼前这有限的时光里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Me no mae no kagiri aru toki o</span></p><p begin="02:46.471" end="02:48.897" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="02:46.471" end="02:46.660">起</span><span begin="02:46.660" end="02:46.848">・</span><span begin="02:46.848" end="02:47.019">承</span><span begin="02:47.019" end="02:47.189">・</span><span begin="02:47.189" end="02:47.358">転</span><span begin="02:47.358" end="02:47.528">・</span><span begin="02:47.528" end="02:47.883">結</span> <span begin="02:47.883" end="02:48.054">よ</span><span begin="02:48.054" end="02:48.253">り</span><span begin="02:48.379" end="02:48.542">ま</span><span begin="02:48.542" end="02:48.702">ず</span><span begin="02:48.702" end="02:48.897">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">比起起承转合的剧本故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Ki･shou･ten･ketsu yori mazu wa</span></p><p begin="02:49.062" end="02:51.251" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="02:49.062" end="02:49.357">楽</span><span begin="02:49.357" end="02:49.558">し</span><span begin="02:49.558" end="02:49.737">む</span><span begin="02:49.737" end="02:49.890">の</span><span begin="02:49.890" end="02:50.060">だ</span> <span begin="02:50.060" end="02:50.388">ワン</span><span begin="02:50.388" end="02:50.563">ダ</span><span begin="02:50.563" end="02:50.793">ー</span><span begin="02:50.890" end="02:51.251">ランド</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">还是先好好享受这座梦幻仙境吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tanoshimu no da wandaarando</span></p><p begin="02:51.897" end="02:54.319" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47"><span begin="02:51.897" end="02:52.213">Tick-</span><span begin="02:52.213" end="02:52.485">Tock</span> <span begin="02:52.752" end="02:52.915">ト</span><span begin="02:52.915" end="02:53.108">キ</span><span begin="02:53.108" end="02:53.266">メ</span><span begin="02:53.266" end="02:53.441">キ</span><span begin="02:53.441" end="02:53.588">追</span><span begin="02:53.588" end="02:53.774">い</span><span begin="02:53.774" end="02:53.937">か</span><span begin="02:53.937" end="02:54.096">け</span><span begin="02:54.096" end="02:54.319">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">Tick-Tock 追逐这份悸动</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tick-Tock tokimeki oikakete</span></p><p begin="02:54.456" end="02:59.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48"><span begin="02:54.456" end="02:54.785">続</span><span begin="02:54.785" end="02:54.999">け</span> <span begin="02:55.102" end="02:55.458">繋</span><span begin="02:55.458" end="02:55.644">げ</span> <span begin="02:55.787" end="02:56.135">君</span><span begin="02:56.135" end="02:56.305">だ</span><span begin="02:56.305" end="02:56.466">け</span><span begin="02:56.466" end="02:56.581">の</span><span begin="02:56.581" end="02:56.646">ス</span><span begin="02:56.646" end="02:56.976">トー</span><span begin="02:56.976" end="02:59.353">リー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">串联 续写 只属于你的故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Tsuzuke tsunage kimi dake no sutoorii</span></p><p begin="03:07.914" end="03:10.015" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49"><span begin="03:07.914" end="03:08.099">い</span><span begin="03:08.099" end="03:08.270">つ</span><span begin="03:08.270" end="03:08.436">で</span><span begin="03:08.436" end="03:08.605">も</span> <span begin="03:08.605" end="03:08.784">ほ</span><span begin="03:08.784" end="03:08.947">ら</span> <span begin="03:08.947" end="03:09.284">ワン</span><span begin="03:09.284" end="03:09.443">ダ</span><span begin="03:09.443" end="03:09.664">ー</span><span begin="03:09.777" end="03:10.015">ランド</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">看啊 无论何时 这里都是美丽仙境</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">Itsudemo hora wandaarando</span></p></div></body></tt>